1895:- Only one level of iframe nesting is expanded (iframes within iframes are not recursed)
1896:- Cross-origin iframes that block accessibility tree access are silently skipped
1897:- Empty iframes or iframes with no interactive content are omitted from the output
1898:- To scope a snapshot to a single iframe, use `frame @ref` then `snapshot -i`
