+- Intended source routes: `/wp-admin/user-new.php`, `/product/slt-daily-core/`, and `/checkout/` in sessions `admin-SLT-CPN-03`, `customer-a-SLT-CPN-03`, and `customer-b-SLT-CPN-03`.
